So, maybe you look at DNREF- DNS records,

00:28:04.420 --> 00:28:07.150
and you see that these, are,

00:28:07.150 --> 00:28:10.140
are a certain offset apart between the IPs that give hosts,

00:28:10.140 --> 00:28:12.060
and then from there you can start to learn,

00:28:12.060 --> 00:28:15.190
