00:28:26.790 --> 00:28:30.680
Actually I have to ask, before didn't- this is a question that must be on people's minds.

00:28:30.680 --> 00:28:30.810
Yeah.

00:28:30.810 --> 00:28:33.570
Which is, what do we do to prevent these kind of things?

00:28:33.570 --> 00:28:37.665
To prevent these? Um, I mean, the bar here,

00:28:37.665 --> 00:28:41.450
I think for IoT is low in many ways from the security perspective.

