00:29:03.800 --> 00:29:06.570
so that they're incentivized to do the right thing?

00:29:06.570 --> 00:29:09.070
Yeah. [NOISE]

00:29:09.070 --> 00:29:13.105
What can we do in terms- what can we do in terms of Internet,

00:29:13.105 --> 00:29:16.480
architecture, and infrastructure to deal with this.

00:29:16.480 --> 00:29:22.320
